WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:26.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.000 --> 01:30.000
"Tamed"

3
01:32.000 --> 01:35.800
(Episode 5: Surrendering in a Kiss)

4
01:36.659 --> 01:37.400
Long time no see.

5
01:37.400 --> 01:38.400
Cheng Yu'an.

6
01:39.180 --> 01:40.259
My parents asked me (Jin Yumo)

7
01:40.260 --> 01:41.239
if you have time for

8
01:41.240 --> 01:42.560
dinner at our place.

9
01:42.920 --> 01:43.840
I'm busy these days.

10
01:43.841 --> 01:44.881
Thank your parents for me.

11
02:16.180 --> 02:17.180
Lin Qi.

12
02:17.280 --> 02:18.280
What are you doing?

13
02:18.580 --> 02:19.620
What were you hoping for?

14
02:38.273 --> 02:39.866
(Zhou Zhi)

15
02:41.020 --> 02:42.020
Hey, Lin Qi.

16
02:42.180 --> 02:43.819
One of your dad's paintings turned up.

17
02:43.939 --> 02:45.699
It's just a bit out of the way.

18
02:46.099 --> 02:47.239
I can't handle this alone.

19
02:47.240 --> 02:48.240
Are you free right now?

20
02:48.639 --> 02:49.580
I am.

21
02:49.580 --> 02:50.400
Send me the address.

22
02:50.400 --> 02:51.400
I'll come over.

23
03:05.520 --> 03:07.359
How did that case turn out?

24
03:07.383 --> 03:08.383
Did you win?

25
03:08.840 --> 03:09.840
Yeah.

26
03:10.360 --> 03:10.879
OK.

27
03:10.879 --> 03:11.500
Glad to hear that.

28
03:11.659 --> 03:12.779
Then I won't keep you.

29
03:12.780 --> 03:13.979
Give my best to your parents.

30
03:14.139 --> 03:15.139
Yumo.

31
03:15.860 --> 03:16.620
Thank you.

32
03:16.780 --> 03:18.860
Next time, there's no need to come all this way.

33
03:19.240 --> 03:20.199
I know.

34
03:20.199 --> 03:21.199
I was just passing by.

35
03:23.620 --> 03:24.620
Cheng Yu'an.

36
03:24.659 --> 03:25.659
I really admire you.

37
03:26.139 --> 03:26.900
But don't worry.

38
03:26.900 --> 03:27.900
I know my boundaries.

39
03:40.060 --> 03:40.860
Cheng Yu'an.

40
03:41.020 --> 03:42.100
I'll go. Something came up.

41
03:42.400 --> 03:43.600
I ate the cupcake, by the way.

42
03:43.759 --> 03:44.340
Matcha flavor.

43
03:44.340 --> 03:45.340
Pretty good.

44
03:46.680 --> 03:47.479
Sorry.

45
03:47.659 --> 03:50.099
The person you are calling is not answering.

46
03:50.879 --> 03:52.259
Please try again later.

47
04:41.939 --> 04:44.339
What dessert flavors do you like?

48
04:45.540 --> 04:46.540
I don't eat sweets often.

49
04:46.959 --> 04:48.540
You must have a favorite flavor.

50
04:51.459 --> 04:52.459
Matcha's fine.

51
05:01.519 --> 05:03.079
We're almost out of milk.

52
05:32.236 --> 05:33.236
(Lin Qi)

53
05:38.420 --> 05:39.220
Sorry.

54
05:39.379 --> 05:41.819
The person you are calling is not answering.

55
05:42.699 --> 05:44.079
Please try again later.

56
06:05.423 --> 06:07.069
[The same message Lin Qi sent earlier]

57
06:51.319 --> 06:52.719
I did find it,

58
06:52.720 --> 06:54.040
but the place...

59
06:55.019 --> 06:56.019
Never mind.

60
06:56.579 --> 06:57.699
Here's the painting.

61
06:58.240 --> 06:59.240
Back in one piece.

62
06:59.660 --> 07:00.739
And I brought him back, too.

63
07:00.740 --> 07:01.740
In one...

64
07:04.019 --> 07:05.319
well, mostly in one piece.

65
07:10.060 --> 07:11.060
OK. I'll head out.

66
07:21.579 --> 07:22.579
Go sit on the couch.

67
08:32.980 --> 08:33.980
Where were you?

68
08:34.580 --> 08:35.740
How did you get hurt?

69
08:36.519 --> 08:38.220
He's only asking as a formality.

70
08:38.519 --> 08:39.779
Don't read too much into it.

71
08:40.879 --> 08:41.879
Answer me.

72
08:45.139 --> 08:47.340
I didn't break the pet residence rules.

73
08:49.019 --> 08:50.279
As for where I go,

74
08:50.700 --> 08:52.019
that's up to me.

75
08:55.919 --> 08:57.559
Why did you leave the bakery on your own?

76
08:57.639 --> 08:59.299
Why go when you knew it was dangerous?

77
08:59.480 --> 09:01.000
Why do you keep getting hurt?

78
09:01.159 --> 09:04.340
Is a painting more important than you?

79
09:18.299 --> 09:20.860
How did you get this painting?

80
09:21.779 --> 09:23.259
I had someone track it down.

81
09:23.480 --> 09:24.480
When?

82
09:25.039 --> 09:25.860
Three days ago.

83
09:25.861 --> 09:27.079
Why didn't you tell me?

84
09:27.080 --> 09:28.179
Tell you?

85
09:28.399 --> 09:29.399
And then what?

86
09:30.139 --> 09:31.740
Let you rush into danger alone?

87
09:32.139 --> 09:33.500
That's my business.

88
09:35.259 --> 09:36.439
Your business?

89
09:36.440 --> 09:37.620
You snuck out,

90
09:38.720 --> 09:39.799
went somewhere like that,

91
09:40.179 --> 09:41.299
and came back hurt.

92
09:41.620 --> 09:42.740
Now you're telling me,

93
09:43.500 --> 09:44.500
"That's my business"?

94
09:45.799 --> 09:46.659
Lin Qi.

95
09:46.820 --> 09:48.139
You live under my roof.

96
09:49.039 --> 09:52.259
Your business is my business.

97
09:54.779 --> 09:55.779
What gives you the right?

98
09:56.659 --> 09:58.539
Is it that Pet Code?

99
09:58.759 --> 10:01.379
Or that I live here with nowhere else to go?

100
10:03.039 --> 10:04.659
You're just putting me up for now.

101
10:05.080 --> 10:06.138
Where I go,

102
10:06.139 --> 10:06.899
what I do,

103
10:06.980 --> 10:07.860
what I care about...

104
10:07.861 --> 10:08.899
None of it is your...

105
10:52.220 --> 10:53.220
Lin Qi.

106
11:24.700 --> 11:25.700
Hello?

107
11:25.759 --> 11:26.759
Hello, Lin Qi?

108
11:26.860 --> 11:27.940
Your mother is awake!

109
11:29.000 --> 11:30.000
My mom's awake?

110
11:30.139 --> 11:30.500
OK.

111
11:30.500 --> 11:31.500
I'll be right there.

112
11:33.419 --> 11:34.419
I'll drive you.

113
11:34.639 --> 11:35.340
No need.

114
11:35.340 --> 11:36.340
My mom just woke up.

115
11:36.559 --> 11:37.679
She won't see outsiders yet.

116
11:42.379 --> 11:43.379
Outsiders?

117
11:54.980 --> 11:56.039
Qiqi.

118
11:56.799 --> 11:57.799
You're back.

119
11:59.019 --> 11:59.500
Mom.

120
11:59.879 --> 12:01.399
You're finally awake.

121
12:02.500 --> 12:03.500
Sweetheart,

122
12:04.179 --> 12:05.179
Don't cry.

123
12:05.639 --> 12:06.700
I'm fine.

124
12:07.460 --> 12:08.600
How do you feel?

125
12:09.240 --> 12:10.659
Is anything bothering you?

126
12:11.039 --> 12:12.320
I feel fine.

127
12:13.379 --> 12:14.700
I'm much better.

128
12:15.720 --> 12:17.799
The nurse said you're still weak.

129
12:18.519 --> 12:20.080
You need to rest.

130
12:21.779 --> 12:24.820
The nurse is exaggerating.

131
12:37.539 --> 12:38.539
Does it hurt?

132
12:39.600 --> 12:40.600
No.

133
12:41.220 --> 12:43.820
It only hurt when the needle went in.

134
12:44.639 --> 12:46.419
It stopped hurting after that.

135
12:47.240 --> 12:48.879
You always say it doesn't hurt.

136
12:52.779 --> 12:54.059
I'm not like you.

137
12:54.860 --> 12:56.820
You fell once as a child

138
12:57.700 --> 12:59.179
and cried all night.

139
13:11.559 --> 13:12.559
Mom.

140
13:12.919 --> 13:14.919
I'll get some warm water to wipe you down.

141
13:15.639 --> 13:16.639
Okay.

142
13:34.679 --> 13:35.879
Honey! Honey, I'm here!

143
13:37.039 --> 13:38.039
Sorry about that.

144
13:44.200 --> 13:44.960
Oh no.

145
13:45.059 --> 13:46.299
It died.

146
13:48.740 --> 13:49.240
Forget it.

147
13:49.241 --> 13:50.481
I'll have it repaired tomorrow.

148
13:51.820 --> 13:52.820
Thanks.

149
13:59.436 --> 14:02.250
[Cheng Yuze badgering him about not responding]

150
14:03.620 --> 14:04.379
Dr. Shen.

151
14:04.380 --> 14:06.139
Your next patient is here for counseling.

152
14:06.399 --> 14:07.240
Send him in.

153
14:07.399 --> 14:08.399
OK.

154
14:18.200 --> 14:19.200
Have a seat.

155
14:24.019 --> 14:25.019
What are you doing here?

156
14:25.220 --> 14:26.299
I booked an appointment.

157
14:26.620 --> 14:27.620
I paid.

158
14:29.720 --> 14:30.779
I didn't schedule you.

159
14:31.059 --> 14:32.419
Scheduling me is your choice.

160
14:33.440 --> 14:34.779
Showing up is mine.

161
14:35.759 --> 14:36.759
You didn't sleep well?

162
14:38.340 --> 14:39.980
You tell me.

163
14:47.220 --> 14:48.379
Busy with work.

164
14:50.519 --> 14:51.638
You avoided me for seven days.

165
14:51.639 --> 14:52.379
Shen Mo.

166
14:52.639 --> 14:53.840
Not answering my calls,

167
14:54.179 --> 14:55.419
or replying to my texts.

168
14:57.539 --> 14:59.299
I thought something fucking happened to you.

169
15:01.419 --> 15:02.419
I wasn't avoiding you.

170
15:03.139 --> 15:04.139
I really was busy.

171
15:10.139 --> 15:11.220
Look at me and say it.

172
15:14.340 --> 15:15.799
Look at me and say it.

173
15:16.460 --> 15:17.460
You don't like me.

174
15:18.620 --> 15:19.940
Say it, and I'll leave.

175
15:22.860 --> 15:24.019
Say it!

176
15:24.620 --> 15:25.899
It's not that I don't like you.

177
15:29.460 --> 15:31.339
I like you.

178
15:31.340 --> 15:32.940
I like you, OK?

179
15:33.879 --> 15:35.440
Ever since I first met you.

180
15:37.159 --> 15:38.979
Since you grabbed my tie in the alley

181
15:38.980 --> 15:40.299
to make sure I loved you.

182
15:40.980 --> 15:42.259
I've liked you all along.

183
15:42.600 --> 15:43.320
Satisfied?

184
15:43.320 --> 15:44.320
Is that enough?

185
15:49.700 --> 15:50.860
But I can't.

186
15:52.799 --> 15:53.840
Because of my dad?

187
15:55.440 --> 15:57.399
You're my brother's therapist and mine,

188
15:58.259 --> 15:59.539
and my dad's spy.

189
16:00.080 --> 16:01.279
Watching my brother,

190
16:02.039 --> 16:03.340
watching me.

191
16:03.659 --> 16:06.859
He hired you from day one.

192
16:06.860 --> 16:07.860
Right?

193
16:10.539 --> 16:11.779
So what?

194
16:12.399 --> 16:13.639
I'm asking you, Shen Mo:

195
16:14.139 --> 16:15.700
are you his

196
16:16.320 --> 16:17.379
or mine?

197
16:19.679 --> 16:20.679
Answer me.

198
16:22.399 --> 16:23.820
I don't belong to anyone.

199
16:24.940 --> 16:25.940
That's not what I asked.

200
16:26.519 --> 16:27.960
I don't care who you are.

201
16:29.200 --> 16:30.940
I don't care what anyone else says.

202
16:31.440 --> 16:33.039
Just tell me one thing.

203
16:35.000 --> 16:36.120
Do you want me?

204
16:39.879 --> 16:41.240
If you don't love me,

205
16:41.740 --> 16:42.940
push me away.

206
16:43.240 --> 16:44.240
Right now.

207
16:45.379 --> 16:46.379
Immediately.

208
16:56.519 --> 16:57.519
It's been five seconds.

209
16:59.600 --> 17:00.740
You haven't pushed me away.

210
17:10.299 --> 17:11.460
So you do want me.

211
17:14.460 --> 17:15.460
Let go.

212
17:16.380 --> 17:18.099
Cheng Yuze, let go.

213
17:40.680 --> 17:43.000
Unless your brother sends you here just for show,

214
17:44.160 --> 17:45.440
don't come for counseling again.

215
17:45.960 --> 17:48.279
I won't provide any therapy or counseling.

216
17:51.500 --> 17:53.019
I'm not someone you should love.

217
17:55.339 --> 17:56.779
We're done.

218
18:24.660 --> 18:25.660
Take a look.

219
18:27.336 --> 18:28.456
[Economic news, art used for money laundering]

220
18:28.480 --> 18:30.018
An exclusive report:

221
18:30.019 --> 18:31.999
key audio in the Lin Yuanshan artwork case.

222
18:32.000 --> 18:34.480
The Cheng family drove up painting prices,

223
18:34.779 --> 18:37.278
creating a steady channel for artwork money laundering.

224
18:37.279 --> 18:39.338
Cheng Group shares hit their daily lower limit,

225
18:39.339 --> 18:40.818
erasing nearly 10 billion in market value.

226
18:40.819 --> 18:42.200
Tomorrow morning,

227
18:44.519 --> 18:45.700
hold a press conference.

228
18:46.539 --> 18:47.539
To announce what?

229
18:48.500 --> 18:51.618
Lin Yuanshan's "Way Back," with a double inscription,

230
18:51.619 --> 18:52.979
was legally acquired by the Group.

231
18:53.519 --> 18:54.919
You'll assist with the investigation,

232
18:54.920 --> 18:56.200
find the heir,

233
18:56.759 --> 18:57.880
and arrange the transfer.

234
18:58.000 --> 18:59.640
But we never bought that painting, right?

235
18:59.960 --> 19:01.960
Whether we acquired it doesn't matter.

236
19:02.380 --> 19:03.939
Right now, this painting

237
19:03.940 --> 19:05.859
is the Group's only shield.

238
19:06.140 --> 19:07.819
It belongs to Lin Yuanshan's son.

239
19:08.579 --> 19:10.099
I have no right to decide for him.

240
19:10.259 --> 19:12.559
Lin Yuanshan's son?

241
19:14.799 --> 19:16.379
This painting is the only thing

242
19:16.380 --> 19:18.920
that can get the Group out of this crisis.

243
19:20.380 --> 19:21.818
You'll speak at tomorrow's press conference.

244
19:21.819 --> 19:22.819
I can't.

245
19:22.920 --> 19:24.220
Cheng Yu'an.

246
19:24.339 --> 19:26.380
The company has thousands of employees,

247
19:27.200 --> 19:28.599
thousands of families.

248
19:29.059 --> 19:30.099
If the Group collapses,

249
19:30.480 --> 19:31.480
what will happen to them?

250
19:31.900 --> 19:36.059
You're protecting a painting for someone you don't even know.

251
19:37.180 --> 19:39.579
But who will protect those thousands of families?

252
19:50.759 --> 19:51.759
What time?

253
19:53.339 --> 19:54.819
Tomorrow at 9 a.m.

254
19:55.259 --> 19:56.259
By the way,

255
19:56.339 --> 19:57.579
in 20 minutes,

256
19:58.200 --> 20:00.140
the Group will hold a PR meeting.

257
20:08.180 --> 20:08.660
Hey.

258
20:08.660 --> 20:09.500
Lin Qi.

259
20:09.680 --> 20:10.480
What a coincidence.

260
20:10.599 --> 20:11.400
Here, this is for you.

261
20:11.400 --> 20:12.400
Second cup's half off.

262
20:12.599 --> 20:14.140
Zhou Zhi? What are you doing here?

263
20:14.400 --> 20:15.419
A friend broke a bone.

264
20:15.420 --> 20:15.980
I came to visit,

265
20:16.339 --> 20:17.339
and got a drink, too.

266
20:17.420 --> 20:17.819
I must say,

267
20:17.819 --> 20:18.559
this latte's good.

268
20:18.560 --> 20:20.058
Tomorrow morning, Cheng Group

269
20:20.059 --> 20:21.495
will hold an emergency press conference

270
20:21.519 --> 20:23.598
on the Lin Yuanshan forgery case.

271
20:23.599 --> 20:24.559
Did you hear that?

272
20:24.560 --> 20:25.900
It's about Cheng Group again.

273
20:26.859 --> 20:28.059
WeChat Moments is blowing up.

274
20:28.440 --> 20:29.755
They say Lin Yuanshan's final work,

275
20:29.779 --> 20:31.019
the original, has surfaced.

276
20:31.380 --> 20:32.740
It's the real thing!

277
20:33.180 --> 20:34.180
Real or not,

278
20:34.440 --> 20:35.560
it's the top trending topic.

279
20:35.839 --> 20:37.778
Even Lin Yuanshan's name is trending!

280
20:37.779 --> 20:38.779
Exactly.

281
20:38.940 --> 20:39.900
Look at this.

282
20:39.901 --> 20:41.358
Apparently, tomorrow morning,

283
20:41.359 --> 20:42.799
they'll hold a press conference.

284
20:43.640 --> 20:44.640
This...

285
20:45.339 --> 20:46.579
My father's final work...

286
20:47.079 --> 20:48.440
is with the Cheng Group?

287
20:49.420 --> 20:51.279
Why hasn't he told me?

288
20:52.700 --> 20:54.402
Zhou Zhi, can I use your phone to make a call?

289
20:54.759 --> 20:55.960
Right now,

290
20:56.099 --> 20:58.480
he's probably holding an emergency meeting at work.

291
21:03.920 --> 21:05.578
The press conference is at 9 tomorrow morning.

292
21:05.579 --> 21:06.440
Need a ride there?

293
21:06.440 --> 21:07.119
Sorry.

294
21:07.120 --> 21:09.719
The person you are calling is not answering.

295
21:09.720 --> 21:11.740
I want to go and ask him myself.

296
21:12.200 --> 21:13.841
OK. I'll pick you up tomorrow morning.

297
21:14.660 --> 21:16.039
But knowing him,

298
21:16.759 --> 21:17.799
he wouldn't do this.

299
21:28.900 --> 21:31.420
Cheng Group hereby declares:

300
21:31.839 --> 21:33.758
The so-called internal recording online

301
21:33.759 --> 21:35.339
was maliciously edited and faked.

302
21:35.619 --> 21:36.639
Also,

303
21:36.640 --> 21:38.459
Lin Yuanshan's original "Way Back"

304
21:38.460 --> 21:40.299
was legally acquired by Cheng Group.

305
21:41.099 --> 21:43.699
The Group is actively seeking the rightful heir

306
21:43.700 --> 21:44.940
to handle the paperwork.

307
21:46.859 --> 21:47.700
Mr. Cheng,

308
21:47.701 --> 21:50.740
Did Cheng Group use this painting to launder money?

309
21:51.279 --> 21:52.759
Art's value lies in its legacy,

310
21:53.160 --> 21:54.200
not in speculation.

311
21:55.559 --> 21:58.740
Is the heir you mentioned Lin Yuanshan's son, Lin Qi?

312
22:04.559 --> 22:07.338
Anyone with information is welcome

313
22:07.339 --> 22:08.539
to contact the Group.

314
22:16.779 --> 22:17.779
Cheng Yu'an.

315
22:17.880 --> 22:18.680
So...

316
22:18.779 --> 22:20.180
Which one's the real you?

317
22:41.579 --> 22:43.880
The person you are calling is not answering.

318
22:44.000 --> 22:45.000
Sorry.

319
22:46.319 --> 22:47.920
Whatever the news says tomorrow,

320
22:48.599 --> 22:49.599
don't believe it.

321
22:50.420 --> 22:51.420
Wait till I explain.

322
22:59.140 --> 23:00.019
(Next Episode) Happy birthday.

323
23:00.019 --> 23:00.799
Lin Qi.

324
23:00.800 --> 23:01.919
It's not what you think.

325
23:01.920 --> 23:03.676
That painting... I was trying to protect it.

326
23:03.700 --> 23:05.680
Is that how you protect it?

327
23:06.420 --> 23:08.119
In front of the entire nation's media?

328
23:09.440 --> 23:11.220
Using it as a bargaining chip?

329
23:12.180 --> 23:13.180
Lin Qi.

330
23:13.880 --> 23:15.240
I love you.

331
23:15.539 --> 23:17.799
I'm hopelessly in love with you.

332
23:18.440 --> 23:19.440
Don't go.

333
23:20.319 --> 23:21.319
Please?

334
23:21.460 --> 23:23.480
If you ever do this again,

335
23:24.099 --> 23:25.259
I'll never...
